          "description_mirror": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "One hackathon. A global community. Two days of building together on the Ligurian coast.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Join the ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "AMD Developer Hackathon: ACT III in Imperia",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and build AI agents, applications, and developer tools using ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "AMD GPUs in the cloud",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " and the ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "ROCm open-source software stack",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "attrs": {
                  "level": 2
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "What is AMD Developer Hackathon: ACT III?",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "It is a hands-on hackathon for people who want to explore what AI can do on real, high-performance infrastructure.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Your goal is to create a working, end-to-end product powered by AMD technology. That could be:",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "bullet_list",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "An AI agent or multi-agent workflow",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "A high-performance AI application",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "A model training or fine-tuning project",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "A tool for AI developers",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "An experiment benchmarking workloads on AMD GPUs",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "A solution ported or optimized for the ROCm ecosystem",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "text": "Something entirely new",
                            "type": "text"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "All development takes place on cloud-accessible AMD GPUs. There is no need to bring or own specialized hardware.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Detailed tracks and challenge requirements will be announced before the kickoff.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "attrs": {
                  "level": 2
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "The Imperia experience",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "The on-site phase will be hosted at ",
                    "type": "text"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "IMPERIAWARE",
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", Imperia\u2019s digital innovation hub and a space designed to support IT companies, startups, talent, and collaborative technology projects.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "It is an opportunity to build in a more focused setting while still being part of an international online hackathon.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Expect:",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "bullet_list",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
